From 9ea603f8b1bb99b784af60d0c9faa58e5057729c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Selfmuser <109387456+selfmusing@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2025 21:53:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [SQUASH]: Revert upstream changes which break
 DOZE_TAP_SCREEN_GESTURE on legacy devices

Revert "base: Default DOZE_TAP_SCREEN_GESTURE to off [1/2]"

This reverts commit beb76aee75c40309df1a4ca8b4c07e84b0b0c627.

Revert "PulsingGestureListener: Adapt to our added sensors options"

This reverts commit a707eaa2d7465128fb2a620d898c8df0e3458b06.

Revert "base: Allow overlaying single tap gesture invocation delay"

This reverts commit 6176c38b0ae1b60834afe6fcc62218766c1b67b2.

Revert "base: Allow configuring wake sensors on ambient [1/2]"

This reverts commit c787dce672ac88344c781d67b99a58c9e206bfda.

Revert "base: Allow configuring haptics for wake gestures [1/2]"

This reverts commit ecf8230ac7941f7da5393a9126737bcd22ada96c.

Revert "base: Allow ambient instead of waking on double tap as well [1/2]"

This reverts commit d5cc3c598195a2daa4c2593c433805ebffc4096b.
